<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse to sign accord with Madrid bourse.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse to sign accord with Madrid bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lisbon bourse said in a statement it planned to sign a protocol with the Madrid bourse on March 13 under which the two authorities would agree to exchange information and know-how. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
